      <simple-id uuid='{FD3224B2-B547-4C49-8D77-5ACE86B9B343}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='Introduction'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Quick Commerce Customer Segmentation - Introduction</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CustomerSegmentation/Introduction?rev=' id='Introduction' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CustomerSegmentation' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-title'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#ff002ff7' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1300' maxwidth='1200' minheight='1300' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='99846' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99834' x='83' y='77'>
            <zone h='99846' id='6' type-v2='layout-basic' w='99834' x='83' y='77'>
              <zone h='17000' id='209' param='Image/Header Banner.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='99834' x='83' y='77'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='82846' id='227' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99834' x='83' y='17077'>
                <zone fixed-size='57' h='82846' id='228' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='5417' x='83' y='17077'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='82846' id='229' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='88917' x='5500' y='17077'>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2462' id='214' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='17077'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='15'>Introduction</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='328' forceUpdate='true' h='25846' id='215' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='19539'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>This dashboard shows the different customer segments created based on the shoppers’ order behaviour. By looking at the categories ordered, items in their basket, time spent before transaction, and other metrics, we are able to create different, independent segments. The aim is to aid discovery of customer related insights by creating these segments based on rules/logic explained below. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>There are different segmentation initiatives ongoing across our global and local Quick Commerce teams - the aim is to collect and harmonise these in a single place to view and analyse these various segments.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Segmentations and inputs used for this segmentation include:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Central Customer Segments </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Foodpanda APAC Customer Segments</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Marketing Tech Segments</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- More to come....</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>You will find the various views of these segments in different tabs above. This dashboard displays the finalised segments of Phase 1 - do note we are continuously tweaking the segments and rules/logic to ensure the robustness of them and are adding more and more countries as we work on Phase 2 and Phase 3. If any question, please reach out to Oktay Aslantas(</run>
                      <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;oktay.aslantas@deliveryhero.com&amp;quot;' italic='true' underline='true'>oktay.aslantas@deliveryhero.com</run>
                      <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#3c4043' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;)&amp;quot;' italic='true' underline='true'>)</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2462' id='216' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='45385'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='15'>Project Plan</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='295' forceUpdate='true' h='23307' id='84' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='47847'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Phase 1:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The first phase of the Customer Segmentation project revolves around gathering inputs from central/local teams on ‘pre-defined’ segments which we created following certain rules and logic explained below. These are then supplemented with segmentations (also based only on order behaviour) by other teams, for example Foodpanda APAC or Marketing Tech. This gives us a clear, first view of the different types of shoppers across our platforms.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Please see this file for explanation and the rules &amp; logic used to create the pre-defined segments: </run>
                      <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1121AuDhshFl-pU5k6K4JjDjA3eNQg_m5/edit&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1121AuDhshFl-pU5k6K4JjDjA3eNQg_m5/edit</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Phase 2 and 3:</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Phase 2 involves using different Machine Learning models (focusing on Customer Lifetime Value, Trial &amp; Reorder Models, and more) to identify different segments of users and add them to the customer segmentation. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Using these results, we will then focus on identifying/creating attributes on brand/category level to gather more insights into the type of products users are ordering, e.g. ‘vegan’ or ‘sugar-free’ products/categories that defines a certain lifestyle. This will then be combined with segments that we can find without pre-set definitions, e.g. ‘unsupervised’ segments that can be identified based on their ordering behaviour + data from brand research, after order surveys, &amp; more.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2462' id='217' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='71154'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='15'>Definitions</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                  <zone fixed-size='343' forceUpdate='true' h='26307' id='218' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='73616'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Alcohol Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Alcohol” master category products.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Discount Shopper:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2 lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% of orders use a discount.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Exploring Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with average session duration of more than 600 seconds in the last 4 weeks. </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Please note that this is all vertical sessions (we cannot split into QC specific sessions).</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Goal Orientated Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with average session duration of less than 60 seconds in the </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>last 4 weeks. </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Please note that this is all vertical sessions (we cannot split into QC specific sessions)</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Guaranteed Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with 0% abandoned cart rate the </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>last 4 weeks, across all verticals.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Fickle Shopper:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than 75% abandoned cart rate the </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>last 4 weeks, across all verticals.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Fresh Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Fresh” master category products.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Snacks Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Snacks” master category products.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Ultra Fresh Shopper:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Ultra Fresh” master category products.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Voucher Shopper: </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2 lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% of orders use a voucher.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Weekend Shopper:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with more than </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>3</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% orders placed on Saturday or Sunday.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Weekday Shopper:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>3</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>lifetime</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% orders placed on Monday - Friday.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    </zone-style>
                  </zone>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='58' h='82846' id='230' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='5500' x='94417' y='17077'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <layout-options>
            <title>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Quick Commerce Customer Segmentation - Introduction</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </title>
          </layout-options>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='302' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='301' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone fixed-size='213' h='17000' id='209' is-fixed='true' param='Image/Header Banner.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='99834' x='83' y='77'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2462' id='214' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='17077'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='15'>Introduction</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='328' forceUpdate='true' h='25846' id='215' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='19539'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>This dashboard shows the different customer segments created based on the shoppers’ order behaviour. By looking at the categories ordered, items in their basket, time spent before transaction, and other metrics, we are able to create different, independent segments. The aim is to aid discovery of customer related insights by creating these segments based on rules/logic explained below. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>There are different segmentation initiatives ongoing across our global and local Quick Commerce teams - the aim is to collect and harmonise these in a single place to view and analyse these various segments.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Segmentations and inputs used for this segmentation include:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Central Customer Segments </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Foodpanda APAC Customer Segments</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Marketing Tech Segments</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- More to come....</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>You will find the various views of these segments in different tabs above. This dashboard displays the finalised segments of Phase 1 - do note we are continuously tweaking the segments and rules/logic to ensure the robustness of them and are adding more and more countries as we work on Phase 2 and Phase 3. If any question, please reach out to Oktay Aslantas(</run>
                    <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;oktay.aslantas@deliveryhero.com&amp;quot;' italic='true' underline='true'>oktay.aslantas@deliveryhero.com</run>
                    <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#3c4043' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;)&amp;quot;' italic='true' underline='true'>)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2462' id='216' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='45385'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='15'>Project Plan</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='295' forceUpdate='true' h='23307' id='84' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='47847'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Phase 1:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>The first phase of the Customer Segmentation project revolves around gathering inputs from central/local teams on ‘pre-defined’ segments which we created following certain rules and logic explained below. These are then supplemented with segmentations (also based only on order behaviour) by other teams, for example Foodpanda APAC or Marketing Tech. This gives us a clear, first view of the different types of shoppers across our platforms.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Please see this file for explanation and the rules &amp; logic used to create the pre-defined segments: </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1121AuDhshFl-pU5k6K4JjDjA3eNQg_m5/edit&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1121AuDhshFl-pU5k6K4JjDjA3eNQg_m5/edit</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Phase 2 and 3:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Phase 2 involves using different Machine Learning models (focusing on Customer Lifetime Value, Trial &amp; Reorder Models, and more) to identify different segments of users and add them to the customer segmentation. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Using these results, we will then focus on identifying/creating attributes on brand/category level to gather more insights into the type of products users are ordering, e.g. ‘vegan’ or ‘sugar-free’ products/categories that defines a certain lifestyle. This will then be combined with segments that we can find without pre-set definitions, e.g. ‘unsupervised’ segments that can be identified based on their ordering behaviour + data from brand research, after order surveys, &amp; more.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2462' id='217' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='71154'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='15'>Definitions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='343' forceUpdate='true' h='26307' id='218' type-v2='text' w='88917' x='5500' y='73616'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Alcohol Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Alcohol” master category products.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Discount Shopper:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2 lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% of orders use a discount.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Exploring Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with average session duration of more than 600 seconds in the last 4 weeks. </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Please note that this is all vertical sessions (we cannot split into QC specific sessions).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Goal Orientated Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with average session duration of less than 60 seconds in the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>last 4 weeks. </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#c63530' fontsize='11'>Please note that this is all vertical sessions (we cannot split into QC specific sessions)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Guaranteed Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with 0% abandoned cart rate the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>last 4 weeks, across all verticals.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Fickle Shopper:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than 75% abandoned cart rate the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>last 4 weeks, across all verticals.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Fresh Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Fresh” master category products.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Snacks Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Snacks” master category products.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Ultra Fresh Shopper:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than 80% of baskets </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>over their lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> contain “Ultra Fresh” master category products.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Voucher Shopper: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2 lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% of orders use a voucher.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Weekend Shopper:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>All customers with more than </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>3</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% orders placed on Saturday or Sunday.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>‣ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Weekday Shopper:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> All customers with more than </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>3</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>lifetime</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> QC orders, and more than 80% orders placed on Monday - Friday.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{C567A068-09AC-4F46-A0B0-5E10C5020B25}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='MKT Tech Segmentation- All Stores'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CustomerSegmentation/MKTTechSegmentation-AllStores?rev=' id='MKTTechSegmentation-AllStores' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CustomerSegmentation' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='parameter-ctrl'>
          <format attr='font-weight' value='bold' />
          <format attr='color' value='#000000' />
          <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
          <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
          <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='parameter-ctrl-title'>
          <format attr='font-weight' value='bold' />
          <format attr='color' value='#000000' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1800' maxwidth='1200' minheight='1800' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource name='Parameters' />
        <datasource caption='user_profiles_segments (cl_dmart)' name='federated.0jaxr8v1p4aspm14xh9z71587fdh' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
        <column alias='Avg. GMV' caption='Metric' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 1]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;GMV&quot;'>
          <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;GMV&quot;' />
          <aliases>
            <alias key='&quot;Discount sum&quot;' value='Avg. discount' />
            <alias key='&quot;GMV&quot;' value='Avg. GMV' />
            <alias key='&quot;Qty ordered&quot;' value='Avg. quantity ordered' />
            <alias key='&quot;Voucher sum&quot;' value='Avg. voucher sum' />
          </aliases>
          <members>
            <member alias='Avg. discount' value='&quot;Discount sum&quot;' />
            <member alias='Avg. GMV' value='&quot;GMV&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;Order count&quot;' />
            <member alias='Avg. quantity ordered' value='&quot;Qty ordered&quot;' />
            <member alias='Avg. voucher sum' value='&quot;Voucher sum&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;Unique Customers&quot;' />
          </members>
        </column>
        <column caption='Timeframe' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 2]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;Lifetime&quot;'>
          <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Lifetime&quot;' />
          <members>
            <member value='&quot;Lifetime&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;Last year&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;16 weeks&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;4 weeks&quot;' />
            <member value='&quot;1 week&quot;' />
          </members>
        </column>
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0jaxr8v1p4aspm14xh9z71587fdh'>
        <column caption='Country' datatype='string' name='[global_entity_id]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
          <aliases>
            <alias key='&quot;FP_HK&quot;' value='Hongkong' />
            <alias key='&quot;FP_MY&quot;' value='Malaysia' />
            <alias key='&quot;FP_PH&quot;' value='Philippines' />
            <alias key='&quot;FP_PK&quot;' value='Pakistan' />
            <alias key='&quot;FP_SG&quot;' value='Singapore' />
            <alias key='&quot;FP_TW&quot;' value='Taiwan' />
            <alias key='&quot;IN_AE&quot;' value='UAE (IN)' />
            <alias key='&quot;OP_SE&quot;' value='Sweden' />
            <alias key='&quot;PY_AR&quot;' value='Argentina' />
            <alias key='&quot;TB_AE&quot;' value='UAE (TB)' />
            <alias key='&quot;TB_KW&quot;' value='Kuwait' />
          </aliases>
        </column>
        <column-instance column='[global_entity_id]' derivation='None' name='[none:global_entity_id:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone h='98000' id='29' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
          <zone fixed-size='115' h='6389' id='31' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98234' x='883' y='1056'>
            <zone fixed-size='107' h='6277' id='317' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2021-10-27 at 14.54.12.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='8917' x='966' y='1112'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#c63530' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6277' id='33' type-v2='text' w='74234' x='9883' y='1112'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='16'>MKT Tech Segmentation</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='16'>      All Stores</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#c63530' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='179' h='6277' id='346' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='14917' x='84117' y='1112'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#c63530' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ca011d' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='1637' h='90944' id='53' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98234' x='883' y='7445'>
            <zone fixed-size='993' h='90944' id='55' is-fixed='true' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='83083' x='883' y='7445'>
              <zone h='90611' id='304' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='82583' x='1167' y='7611'>
                <zone fixed-size='241' forceUpdate='true' h='13389' id='305' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='82583' x='1167' y='7611'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Frequency Segment</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Based on Marketing Tech segmentation, tailored for QC orders.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Possible values - A, B, C, D, E, F, M, N</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“N” - new customers who ordered for the first time in the last 4 weeks</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“M” - new customers who ordered for the first time between the the last 4 and 8 weeks</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“F” - customers who have only ordered once in their lifetime</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“E” - customers who have ordered zero or one time in the last 4 months</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>All the rest of the customers (that is, customers that have ordered for the first time more than 8 weeks ago and that have placed at least 2 orders in the last 4 months) are classified in the segments A to D based on their lifetime frequency.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Lifetime frequency is calculated by: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“A” - 75th or above percentile in terms of lifetime frequency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“B” - 50th to 75th percentile in terms of lifetime frequency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“C” - 25th to 50th percentile in terms of lifetime frequency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“D” - 25th or below percentile in terms of lifetime frequency</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='240' h='13777' id='306' is-fixed='true' name='AllStores_freq' show-title='false' w='82583' x='1167' y='21000'>
                  <layout-cache cell-count-w='8' minheight='121' non-cell-size-w='30' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='145' forceUpdate='true' h='8500' id='312' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='82583' x='1167' y='34777'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Monetary Segment</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Based on Marketing Tech segmentation, tailored for QC orders.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Segments created based on average GMV percentile rank vs other QC customers in the same entity.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>If a QC order is placed in the last 4 months:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>“L”</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> - below 25th percentile rank</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>“M”</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> - between 25th and 75th percentile rank</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>“H”</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> - above 75th percentile rank</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>“No recent orders” -  if no orders placed in last 4 months.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='233' h='13388' id='308' is-fixed='true' name='AllStores_monetary' show-title='false' w='82583' x='1167' y='43277'>
                  <layout-cache cell-count-w='4' minheight='126' non-cell-size-w='30' type-h='scalable' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4500' id='314' type-v2='text' w='82583' x='1167' y='56665'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Discount Segment</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Based on Marketing Tech segmentation, tailored for QC orders.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Segments created based on proportion of total order value that is made up by incentives (discount + voucher) used for orders in the last 4 months.  </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='252' h='14444' id='311' is-fixed='true' name='AllStores_discountsegment' show-title='false' w='82583' x='1167' y='61165'>
