                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Basket Size Sement</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Based on Marketing Tech segmentation, tailored for QC orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Segments created based on average quantities ordered per order vs other QC customers in the same entity. </run>
